      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "For Event #1, players will be selected through a Nouns GG round. Each applicant must submit a brief proposal explaining why they should be invited to participate. Once the submission period ends, Nouns GG community members will vote to determine the first 8 competitors.",
